      "text": "Ptolomea, where traitors to their guests lie face up in the ice, their tears frozen over their eyes. Here a soul may fall before its body dies, while a demon wears the body above. The frozen tears are unseen until someone breaks them. Keep vigil, and your soul will be returned to you; then walk the twin flame together, each holding it back for the other."
